sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Faculty as Faculty Member
    box Faculty UI (App Container)
    participant UI as Faculty Frontend<br/>(Course Builder)
    end
    box Backend (App Container)
    participant Auth as Auth & RBAC Guard
    participant API as Course Builder Service
    end
    box Storage
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database
    end
    box Student UI (App Container)
    participant StudentUI as Student Frontend<br/>(Learning Platform)
    end

    Faculty->>UI: 1. Select Parent Program & Click "Create Course"
    UI->>Auth: 2. POST /api/tenant-courses (Payload + Session Token)
    Auth-->>API: 3. Permission Verified (Role = Faculty)
    API->>DB: 4. INSERT INTO tenant_courses (origin_type, local_code, local_title)
    DB-->>API: 5. Course ID Created (AC9-001)

    Faculty->>UI: 6. Add/Reorder Chapters (Canonical or Custom)
    UI->>API: 7. POST /api/tenant-course-chapters (chapter_ids, positions)
    API->>DB: 8. UPSERT tenant_chapters & tenant_course_chapters

    Faculty->>UI: 9. Stitch Concepts (Canonical or Custom)
    UI->>API: 10. POST /api/tenant-chapter-concepts (concept_ids, positions)
    API->>DB: 11. UPSERT tenant_concepts & tenant_chapter_concepts

    Faculty->>UI: 12. Click "Publish Course"
    UI->>API: 13. PUT /api/tenant-courses/AC9-001/publish
    API->>DB: 14. UPDATE tenant_courses SET status = 'published'
    DB-->>API: 15. Status Updated & Enrollment Bounds Validated

    API-->>StudentUI: 16. Course Manifested on Student Learning Platform
